Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.02,0:00:12.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}In a season of dreams,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在这个梦幻般的赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:17.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Maja Chwalinska comes through, emerging battle-hardened{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赫瓦林斯卡历经苦战
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.32,0:00:19.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to defeat Maria Sakkari{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N击败萨卡里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:22.52,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to reach her third career WTA semifinal.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N生涯第三次跻身巡回赛四强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:27.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}As Iga Swiatek rolls through in straight sets,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯瓦泰克直落两盘过关
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:29.62,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}six-four, six-one,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:31.80,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and will face fellow Pole Maja Chwalinska in the semifinals.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N半决赛将对阵同胞赫瓦林斯卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.30,0:00:34.34,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Jesteśmy mistrzami Europy!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我们是欧洲冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:37.18,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}12{\fs68}年前 她们第一次隔网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.18,0:00:39.96,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}年前 她们站上同一个领奖台
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.96,0:00:43.17,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次 只有一个人能走进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.76,0:00:46.03,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}17{\fs68}号晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.03,0:00:47.49,TL,,0,0,0,,武汉{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.49,0:00:49.55,TL,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克对赫瓦林斯卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.55,0:00:50.77,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛的半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.77,0:00:53.19,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次由两个波兰人来打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.76,0:00:57.81,TL,,0,0,0,,赫瓦林斯卡说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.81,0:00:59.60,TL,,0,0,0,,感觉自己认识她一辈子了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:02.02,TL,,0,0,0,,因为她们是一起开始打比赛的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.94,0:01:09.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Maja Chwalińska, mam 14 lat,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我是玛雅 赫瓦林斯卡 {\fs78}14{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.04,0:01:11.90,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}mieszkam w Dąbrowie Górniczej{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N住在达布罗瓦古尔尼恰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.90,0:01:17.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}i trenuję od 7 roku życia.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}7{\fs68}岁开始练球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.16,0:01:20.08,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Nazywam się Iga Świątek, mam 14 lat,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我叫伊加 斯瓦泰克 {\fs78}14{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:21.94,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}trenuję w Warszawskim Klubie Tenisowym Mera,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在华沙梅拉网球俱乐部训练
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:24.15,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}trenuje mnie Michał Kaznowski i gram od 8 lat.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N教练是卡兹诺夫斯基 打球{\fs78}8{\fs68}年了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.77,0:01:25.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Jesteśmy zgrane.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我们很合得来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.35,0:01:28.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ja z Mają już byłam na kilku drużynówkach,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我和玛雅打过好几次团体赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.53,0:01:29.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}dobrze się znamy,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N很了解彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.81,0:01:30.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}zagadujemy się.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N总有聊不完的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.19,0:01:35.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Czasami oczywiście są jakieś sprzeczki,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N当然 有时也会拌嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.09,0:01:37.77,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}ale potrafimy szybko to rozwiązać.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但我们很快就能和好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.39,0:01:40.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Nie gram tak jakoś siłowo jak większość dziewczyn,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我不像大多数女孩那样靠力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.91,0:01:43.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}więc gram bardziej tak wszechstronnie,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N所以打得更全面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.11,0:01:46.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}dużo slice'ów, zmianę rotacji, to jest taka moja gra.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N切削 变旋转 这就是我的打法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.41,0:01:51.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I myślę, że w większości meczów to jest kluczem,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我觉得很多比赛里 关键在于
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.41,0:01:57.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}że wygrywam na przykład mecze dzięki temu, że lepiej gram właśnie w takich kluczowych momentach:{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我能在关键分上打得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.71,0:02:01.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}slice'y, różne takie zmiany rytmu, a nie tylko bum-bum.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N切削和节奏变化 不只是砰砰砰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.51,0:02:02.45,TL,,0,0,0,,两个人搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.45,0:02:04.42,TL,,0,0,0,,拿下了欧洲青少年锦标赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.42,0:02:07.50,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}14{\fs68}岁组和{\fs78}16{\fs68}岁组的双打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:09.86,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2016{\fs68}年青少年联合会杯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.86,0:02:12.72,TL,,0,0,0,,赢下最后一分 她们抱在了一起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.61,0:02:18.45,TL,,0,0,0,,那年秋天在斯德哥尔摩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:19.78,TL,,0,0,0,,两个{\fs78}15{\fs68}岁的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.78,0:02:21.40,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次在职业赛里交手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.40,0:02:22.95,TL,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.95,0:02:25.17,TL,,0,0,0,,几个月后的澳网 两个人搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.17,0:02:28.28,TL,,0,0,0,,打进青少年女双决赛 拿了亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.61,0:02:34.78,TL,,0,0,0,,后来 两个人走上了完全不同的路
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.61,0:02:39.81,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2020{\fs68}年 {\fs78}19{\fs68}岁的斯瓦泰克拿下法网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.81,0:02:42.25,TL,,0,0,0,,波兰第一个大满贯单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.25,0:02:44.80,TL,,0,0,0,,后来 她当上了世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.11,0:02:50.24,TL,,0,0,0,,同一时间 赫瓦林斯卡却撑不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.24,0:02:52.85,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2021{\fs68}年 {\fs78}19{\fs68}岁的她因为抑郁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.85,0:02:54.94,TL,,0,0,0,,暂停了职业生涯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:02:59.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, I needed to take a break.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我需要停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:05.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And I honestly didn't know if I'm gonna come back or not, to be like honest with you.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N说实话 我不知道还会不会回来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.51,0:03:08.70,TL,,0,0,0,,一年后 她回到了赛场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.70,0:03:09.49,TL,,0,0,0,,这些年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.49,0:03:11.93,TL,,0,0,0,,两个人也一直是国家队的队友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.93,0:03:13.26,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年联合杯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.26,0:03:14.39,TL,,0,0,0,,她们都在波兰队
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.39,0:03:16.21,TL,,0,0,0,,一起打进了决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.71,0:03:21.51,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I think it's the third year in a row we're making semis or better.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我们连续三年打进四强以上了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:25.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So two years ago it was semis, last year it was a final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N前年是四强 去年是决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.49,0:03:27.89,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So you guys answer the question, what's coming tomorrow.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N明天会怎样 你们来回答吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.93,0:03:31.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Team Poland into the finals. Well done, congratulations!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N波兰队打进决赛 恭喜！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.41,0:03:33.50,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:35.74,TL,,0,0,0,,两个人都等来了自己的高光
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.74,0:03:37.13,TL,,0,0,0,,先是{\fs78}6{\fs68}月的巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.13,0:03:39.04,TL,,0,0,0,,轮到赫瓦林斯卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.41,0:03:42.24,TL,,0,0,0,,世界第{\fs78}114{\fs68}的她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:44.18,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛赢下施奈德
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:45.94,TL,,0,0,0,,她成了法网历史上第一个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.94,0:03:48.53,TL,,0,0,0,,从资格赛打进决赛的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.25,0:04:09.37,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You are in Roland Garros' final. How does it sound?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你打进法网决赛了 感觉怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.19,0:04:16.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I mean, like a dream, honestly.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N说真的 像做梦一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.09,0:04:18.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I don't know what's going on.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我都不知道发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.49,0:04:22.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm just...{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我只是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.11,0:04:24.67,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, I don't know what to say.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我不知道该说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.77,0:04:26.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm sorry. I'm just very happy.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N抱歉 我就是太开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.21,0:04:29.42,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛她输给了安德烈耶娃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.42,0:04:30.55,TL,,0,0,0,,可这一趟巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.55,0:04:34.51,TL,,0,0,0,,让她的排名从第{\fs78}114{\fs68}升到了第{\fs78}21{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.95,0:04:42.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I will definitely not forget these three weeks.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这三个星期 我一定不会忘记
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.61,0:04:46.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Paris will stay forever in my heart. Merci.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N巴黎会永远留在我心里 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.01,0:04:49.98,TL,,0,0,0,,两个月后的多伦多 轮到斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.98,0:04:52.62,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛她{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}赢下莱巴金娜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.62,0:04:54.08,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}8{\fs68}个发球局一个没丢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:56.45,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到了这个赛季的第一个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.67,0:05:04.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sensational, Swiatek takes the title in Toronto.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N精彩！斯瓦泰克拿下多伦多冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.33,0:05:11.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}6-2, 6-3, it's Iga Swiatek, the champion in Canada.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 冠军是斯瓦泰克！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.71,0:05:13.02,TL,,0,0,0,,这个星期在武汉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.02,0:05:15.57,TL,,0,0,0,,赫瓦林斯卡{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘赢下萨卡里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.57,0:05:16.81,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘第{\fs78}12{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.81,0:05:18.15,TL,,0,0,0,,她破了萨卡里的发球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:19.81,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次打进{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛四强
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.81,0:05:22.83,TL,,0,0,0,,下周一还会第一次进入世界前{\fs78}20{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.01,0:05:29.35,TL,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克也是两盘过关
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.35,0:05:30.56,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}站{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:33.04,TL,,0,0,0,,她每一站都打进过半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.91,0:05:37.64,TL,,0,0,0,,赛后她说 两个波兰人都进了半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.64,0:05:39.62,TL,,0,0,0,,对波兰网球意义很大
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.62,0:05:41.46,TL,,0,0,0,,她真为赫瓦林斯卡高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:44.29,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年赫瓦林斯卡进步了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.29,0:05:45.87,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}年前在斯德哥尔摩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.87,0:05:47.16,TL,,0,0,0,,赢的是斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.16,0:05:47.77,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.77,0:05:50.47,TL,,0,0,0,,是她们第一次在巡回赛上相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.59,0:05:55.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And when it seemed the experience of Sakkari{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N当萨卡里的经验似乎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.57,0:05:57.21,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}might prevail in the end,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就要占上风时
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.49,0:05:59.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Maja says, “No, no, not this year,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N玛雅说 不 今年不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.93,0:06:00.77,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}not this tournament.”{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这项赛事也不行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.06,0:06:01.75,TL,,0,0,0,,这一场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.75,0:06:04.11,TL,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克要冲击她第一个武汉决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.11,0:06:05.54,TL,,0,0,0,,赫瓦林斯卡要冲击的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.54,0:06:07.67,TL,,0,0,0,,是生涯第一个{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.67,0:06:10.57,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}年前一起举着亚军奖盘的两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.57,0:06:13.15,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次只能有一个人往前走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.15,0:06:14.51,TL,,0,0,0,,你站谁？
